sequenceDiagram
    participant PM as Project Manager
    participant UI as Web Interface
    participant API as API Gateway
    participant PS as Project Service
    participant WF as Workflow Service
    participant NS as Notification Service
    participant DB as Database
    
    PM->>UI: Navigate to Create Field Plan
    UI->>API: GET /api/v1/projects (fetch available projects)
    API->>PS: Forward request
    PS->>DB: Query projects for user
    DB-->>PS: Return projects
    PS-->>API: Return project list
    API-->>UI: Return project list
    UI-->>PM: Display project selection
    
    PM->>UI: Fill field plan details
    PM->>UI: Upload facilities Excel file
    UI->>API: POST /api/v1/field-plans (create field plan)
    API->>PS: Forward request
    PS->>DB: Validate and create field plan
    DB-->>PS: Return created field plan
    PS-->>API: Return field plan details
    API-->>UI: Return success response
    UI-->>PM: Show field plan created
    
    PM->>UI: Assign activities to SPOCs
    UI->>API: POST /api/v1/field-plans/{id}/assign-activities
    API->>PS: Forward assignment request
    PS->>DB: Create activity assignments
    DB-->>PS: Return assignment records
    PS->>WF: Initialize facility activities
    WF->>DB: Create facility activities (SCHEDULED status)
    DB-->>WF: Return facility activities
    WF->>NS: Send assignment notifications
    NS->>NS: Send emails to assigned SPOCs
    PS-->>API: Return assignment success
    API-->>UI: Return success response
    UI-->>PM: Show assignment completed
    
    Note over PM,DB: Activity SPOCs receive notifications and can now log in to manage their assignments
    
    participant AS as Activity SPOC
    AS->>UI: Login and view assignments
    UI->>API: GET /api/v1/activity-assignments/assigned-to-me
    API->>PS: Forward request
    PS->>DB: Query assignments for user
    DB-->>PS: Return assignments
    PS-->>API: Return assignment list
    API-->>UI: Return assignment list
    UI-->>AS: Display assigned activities
    
    AS->>UI: Assign facilities to field staff
    UI->>API: POST /api/v1/facility-activities/{id}/assign-user
    API->>WF: Forward assignment
    WF->>DB: Update facility activity with assigned user
    DB-->>WF: Return updated record
    WF->>WF: Check activation conditions
    WF->>DB: Update status to ACTIVE if conditions met
    DB-->>WF: Return updated status
    WF->>NS: Notify field staff if activated
    NS->>NS: Send notification to field staff
    WF-->>API: Return assignment success
    API-->>UI: Return success response
    UI-->>AS: Show assignment completed 